pro_course_detail.description:
This is a support package and NOT an actual lesson! 
This is perfect if you desire support with texting, voice messages, or exercises to improve your grammar. 

This support could look like 
} writing sentences or paragraphs  (which I will correct)
} grammar exercises (I send you the exercises, you do them and send them back and I correct them) 
} test preparation
} desiring help with translations or proofreading
} voice messages (which I will correct)

You create your own experiences and get to use the package as much as you want. I am very active and respond daily to messages. This is an accelerated package for you to immerse yourself in the German language and culture. 

Book one session for a week of support 
Book the package for a month of support

If you have questions please message me!
